    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Smyth Residential proudly presents 6 Templeville Road, a beautifully proportioned semi-detached family home, meticulously maintained and in good condition throughout. This charming home features a sunny south-facing rear garden and offers great potential to expand via the attic space, subject to planning permission. The light-filled rooms are spacious and well-appointed, reflecting the loving care given by the current owners.\r\n\r\n6 Templeville Road occupies a prime spot in a mature, convenient residential neighbourhood, just a short stroll from Templeogue Village, Bushy Park, and numerous highly regarded schools and sporting facilities, offering the perfect blend of vibrant village life and modern convenience. The location is second to none, within walking distance of an excellent selection of well-established primary and secondary schools, including Templeogue College, Our Lady’s School, Terenure College, St. Joseph’s Boys, Presentation Terenure and St. Pius X National School. Nearby recreational and shopping amenities include Bushy Park, Rathfarnham Shopping Centre, and the charming villages of Templeogue and Terenure. Multiple bus routes offer easy access to the city centre, while the nearby M50 motorway connects to all major national routes—making this an exceptional opportunity for discerning buyers seeking a forever home in a prime location.\r\n\r\nCovering 173 square meters, the accommodation comprises an entrance porch, hallway, lounge, dining room, family room, kitchen, utility room, sunroom, study or fifth bedroom with en-suite, four upstairs bedrooms, a bathroom, and a separate WC. Viewings are highly recommended and available by appointment only—don’t miss the chance to see this exceptional home."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Porch\r\n1.81m x 2.00m (5' 11\" x 6' 7\")\r\nTiled floor. Double doors with glazed insets leading to:\r\n\r\nHallway\r\n2.43m x 4.85m (8' 0\" x 15' 11\")\r\nDecorative coving. Smoke alarm.\r\n\r\nGuest Wc\r\n0.82m x 1.45m (2' 8\" x 4' 9\")\r\nFully tiled with white wc and wash hand basin.\r\n\r\nLiving Room\r\n3.57m x 4.11m (11' 9\" x 13' 6\")\r\nFeature fireplace. Decorative coving. Tv point. Archway to:\r\n\r\nDining Room\r\n3.55m x 4.55m (11' 8\" x 14' 11\")\r\nDecorative coving. Door leading to Sun Room.\r\n\r\nFamily Room\r\n4.03m x 3.65m (13' 3\" x 12' 0\")\r\nFeature media wall. Hotpress with immersion. Decorative coving.\r\n\r\nKitchen\r\n3.01m x 3.01m (9' 11\" x 9' 11\")\r\nWall and base fitted units. Area of worktop space. Double stainless steel sink unit. Plumbed for dishwasher. Zanussi hob with extractor hood. Integrated Beko microwave oven and Zanussi oven. Integrated Zanussi fridge freezer. \r\n\r\nUtility Room\r\n1.05m x 4.05m (3' 5\" x 13' 3\")\r\nPlumbed for washing machine.\r\n\r\nSun Room\r\n3.24m x 5.25m (10' 8\" x 17' 3\")\r\nSemi-solid flooring. Sliding door to garden.\r\n\r\nBedroom 5/Study\r\n2.55m x 3.81m (8' 4\" x 12' 6\")\r\nSuitable for a variety of uses.\r\n\r\nEn-suite\r\n1.94m x 2.38m (6' 4\" x 7' 10\")\r\nFully tiled with white wc and wash hand basin with storage. Triton t90st electric shower. Heated towel rack. Recess\r\nlighting.\r\n\r\nUpstairs\r\n\r\nLanding\r\n2.51m x 2.75m (8' 3\" x 9' 0\")\r\nLadder leading to floored attic (4.08m x 4.87m) with potential for conversion (subject to pp).\r\n\r\nBedroom 1\r\n3.50m x 4.27m (11' 6\" x 14' 0\")\r\nTo front. Wall to wall fitted wardrobes.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2\r\n3.43m x 4.40m (11' 3\" x 14' 5\")\r\nTo rear. Array of wall to wall fitted wardrobes with vanity unit. Wall lights.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3\r\n2.51m x 3.39m (8' 3\" x 11' 1\")\r\nTo front. Fitted wardrobe.\r\n\r\nBedroom 4\r\n2.78m x 2.52m (9' 1\" x 8' 3\")\r\nTo rear.\r\n\r\nBathroom\r\n1.53m x 2.60m (5' 0\" x 8' 6\")\r\nFully tiled with white wash hand basin and bath. Separate Mira pumped shower with screen.\r\n\r\nSeparate WC\r\n0.82m x 1.71m (2' 8\" x 5' 7\")\r\nWhite wc.\r\n\r\nOutside\r\n\r\nFront: Driveway with space for two cars. Well maintained lawn. Outside light.\r\nRear: Well maintained south facing walled garden. Lawn bordered by well-stocked flowerbeds.\r\nGarden Shed 1 (4.61m x 0.87m)\r\nGarden Shed 2: (3.00m x 2.67m)"
